# Put your multiplayer HOST save folder here (e.g. "Farmhands_123456789/").
# Create the farm on your own PC first: New -> Co-op -> add cabins -> play one day ->
# sleep to save, then copy the save folder from:
#   Windows: %APPDATA%\StardewValley\Saves
#   Linux:   ~/.config/StardewValley/Saves
#   macOS:   ~/.config/StardewValley/Saves
